	<rowsItem>
		<index>7</index>
		<row>
			<formatIndex>5</formatIndex>
			<c>
				<c>
					<f>8</f>
					<tl>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>en</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>between [RepresentationOfTheOrganization] and [CounterpartyName_]</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>fa</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>بین [RepresentationOfTheOrganization] و [CounterpartyName_]</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>it</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>tra [RepresentationOfTheOrganization] e [CounterpartyName_]</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>pl</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>między [RepresentationOfTheOrganization] i [CounterpartyName_]</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>ru</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>между [RepresentationOfTheOrganization] и [CounterpartyName_]</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>tr</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>[RepresentationOfTheOrganization] ve [CounterpartyName_] arasında</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>vi</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>giữa [RepresentationOfTheOrganization] và [CounterpartyName_]</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
					</tl>
				</c>
			</c>
		</row>
	</rowsItem>
	<rowsItem>
		<index>8</index>
		<row>
			<empty>true</empty>
		</row>
	</rowsItem>
	<rowsItem>
		<index>9</index>
		<row>
			<formatIndex>5</formatIndex>
			<c>
				<c>
					<f>9</f>
					<tl>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>en</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>   We, the undersigned, [JobTitleExecutive] [RepresentationOfTheOrganization] [ManagerSFullName_], on the one hand, and [JobTitleOfCounterpartyExecutive] [CounterpartyName_] [FullNameOfCounterpartyExecutive], on the other hand, prepared the present reconciliation statement to certify that</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>fa</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>ما امضاکنندگان زیر، [JobTitleExecutive] [RepresentationOfTheOrganization] [ManagerSFullName_]، از یک طرف، و [JobTitleOfCounterpartyExecutive] [CounterpartyName_] [FullNameOfCounterpartyExecutive]، از طرف دیگر، این صورت تطبیق را برای تأیید موارد زیر تهیه کردیم</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>ru</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>   Мы, нижеподписавшиеся, [JobTitleExecutive] [RepresentationOfTheOrganization] [ManagerSFullName_], с одной стороны, и [JobTitleOfCounterpartyExecutive] [CounterpartyName_] [FullNameOfCounterpartyExecutive], с другой стороны, составили настоящий акт сверки в том, что:</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>tr</v8:lang>
							<v8:content> Biz, aşağıda imzası bulunan [RepresentationOfTheOrganization]'nın [JobTitleExecutive]'sı [ManagerSFullName_] bir taraftan ve [CounterpartyName_]'nın [JobTitleOfCounterpartyExecutive]'sı [FullNameOfCounterpartyExecutive] diğer taraftan, aşağıdaki hususları içeren işbu mutabakat belgesini düzenlemiş bulunmaktayız:</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>vi</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>   Chúng tôi bao gồm một bên là [JobTitleExecutive] [RepresentationOfTheOrganization] [ManagerSFullName_] và một bên là[JobTitleOfCounterpartyExecutive] [CounterpartyName_] [FullNameOfCounterpartyExecutive] cùng ký biên bản đối chiếu này về việc:</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>it</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>   We, the undersigned, [JobTitleExecutive] [RepresentationOfTheOrganization] [ManagerSFullName_], on the one hand, and [JobTitleOfCounterpartyExecutive] [CounterpartyName_] [FullNameOfCounterpartyExecutive], on the other hand, prepared the present reconciliation statement to certify that</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>pl</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>   We, the undersigned, [JobTitleExecutive] [RepresentationOfTheOrganization] [ManagerSFullName_], on the one hand, and [JobTitleOfCounterpartyExecutive] [CounterpartyName_] [FullNameOfCounterpartyExecutive], on the other hand, prepared the present reconciliation statement to certify that</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
					</tl>
				</c>
			</c>
		</row>
	</rowsItem>
	<rowsItem>
		<index>10</index>
		<row>
			<empty>true</empty>
		</row>
	</rowsItem>
	<rowsItem>
		<index>11</index>
		<row>
			<c>
				<c>
					<f>10</f>
					<tl>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>en</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>   1. [PresentationOfTheSettlementPeriod] the following settlements were made:</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>fa</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>1. [PresentationOfTheSettlementPeriod] تسویه‌های زیر انجام شد:</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>ru</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>   1. [PresentationOfTheSettlementPeriod] были осуществлены следующие расчеты:</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>tr</v8:lang>
							<v8:content> 1. [Hesaplama Döneminin Sunumu] aşağıdaki hesaplamalar yapılmıştır:</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>vi</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>   1. [PresentationOfTheSettlementPeriod] đã thực hiện những phép tính sau:</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>it</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>   1. [PresentationOfTheSettlementPeriod] the following settlements were made:</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>pl</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>   1. [PresentationOfTheSettlementPeriod] the following settlements were made:</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
					</tl>
				</c>
			</c>
		</row>
	</rowsItem>
